C4</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use C4 to destroy doors and clean areas. Pay attention to know all the details hidden behind the door before destroying it. <strong>CLEAN !</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368840/extras/d51d12065b2e9f9e928379d4bb810010.poster.avif?t=1742806985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368840/extras/d51d12065b2e9f9e928379d4bb810010.webm?t=1742806985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368840/extras/d51d12065b2e9f9e928379d4bb810010.mp4?t=1742806985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AMMUNITION BOX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ammunition boxes are concealed in the rooms. You won\u2019t survive without finding them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368840/extras/ba42053b2152c19ebb7ceb16437a9624.poster.avif?t=1742806985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368840/extras/ba42053b2152c19ebb7ceb16437a9624.webm?t=1742806985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368840/extras/ba42053b2152c19ebb7ceb16437a9624.mp4?t=1742806985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several mines are hidden in the rooms. Be extremely vigilant, and use them to your advantage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368840/extras/83cc657f8bf29ea881c51016d